# v1.0.6 
- Добавлен API endpoint 
```POST /SendIrma 
```
для приема данных от датчиков пасспотока
пример payload
```
{
    "geo" : {
          "direction" : 82.29,
          "is_valid" : "A",
          "lat_hemisphere" : "N",
          "latitude" : 60.0151117,
          "lon_hemisphere" : "E",
          "longitude" : null,
          "mode" : "A",
          "record_id" : 0,
          "satellites_count" : 14,
          "speed" : 0,
          "time" : "2026-03-12T10:36:19+00:00"
       },
    "pass_counts": {
      "counts_by_door": {
        "1": {
          "boarding": 0,
          "alighting": 2,
          "raw_payload": "0002",
          "opcode": "E",
          "range_limited_to_255": true,
          "e_after_f_sec": 0.0009333310008514673
        },
        "2": {
          "boarding": 0,
          "alighting": 0,
          "raw_payload": "0000",
          "opcode": "E",
          "range_limited_to_255": true,
          "e_after_f_sec": 0.00079420600013691
        },
        "3": {
          "boarding": 0,
          "alighting": 0,
          "raw_payload": "0000",
          "opcode": "E",
          "range_limited_to_255": true,
          "e_after_f_sec": 0.001496247001341544
        }
      },
      "counts_total": {
        "boarding": 0,
        "alighting": 2
      }
    }
}
```
В случае успеха возвращается `{"result": "ok"}` 
В конфиге добавлен параметр System.ServerPort
